# dots3-note preview (dots-studio, August 2026): 280B MoE, 16B active, a 512k window.
# Compressed attention plus sliding windows keep its cache small. Only a 2-bit build fits
# beside a cache here (99 GB), and it is a preview release. Apache-2.0.
# With a 16-bit cache and the 10 GB margin the fit gave it 414,976 tokens (2026-10-15),
# under the 500k target. An 8-bit cache, as for Seed-OSS and K2, fits the whole 524,288.
TITLE="dots3-note preview"
DETAIL="280B, 16B active, 2-bit GGUF, 99 GB"
HF_REPO=bartowski/dots-studio_dots3-note-prev-GGUF
HF_INCLUDE="*Q2_K/*"
GGUF_MATCH="Q2_K-"
ALIAS=dots3-note
CTX=fit
CTX_MIN=262144
KV_TYPE=q8_0
MIN_FREE_GB=100
EXTRA_ARGS="--load-mode dio --cache-ram 0 --timeout 14400 --reasoning on --reasoning-format auto"
